<title>NETHERLANDS: SMIT INTERNATIONALE H1 NET UP AT DFL 10.6 MILLION.</title>
<headline>SMIT INTERNATIONALE H1 NET UP AT DFL 10.6 MILLION.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   10.6   vs   9.8</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    13.7  vs  17.7</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Smit Internationale</p>
<p>    Tax					1.1  vs   0.8 </p>
<p>    Operating profit per sector:     </p>
<p>    - Maritime contracts		11.7  vs  11.8</p>
<p>    - Offshore			     1.3  vs   0.5</p>
<p>    - Port &amp; Coastal		     0.7  vs   5.4</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     7.2  vs   8.1</p>
<p>    Third party interest	  loss 0.1  vs   0.5 loss</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 - 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
